      "body": "`--cuda-graph-backend-decode breakable` aborts at decode-graph capture for any model whose decode forward returns a `LogitsProcessorOutput`. GLM-5.3-Flash on the DSA path is one:\n\n```\nFile \".../runner_backend/breakable_cuda_graph_backend.py\", line 197, in _alloc_full_buffer\n    raise TypeError(f\"Unsupported BCG output type: {type(output)}\")\nTypeError: Unsupported BCG output type: <class 'sglang.srt.layers.logits_processor.LogitsProcessorOutput'>\n```\n\nThe three structure-walkers that manage the shared output buffer (`_alloc_full_buffer`, `_slice_output`, `_copy_output_to_buffer`) only handle tensors, `PPProxyTensors`, tuples and lists, so the `LogitsProcessorOutput` dataclass the decode path returns falls through to the `raise`. `full` and `tc_piecewise` reach a serving state on the same command, only `breakable` trips here.\n\nThe fix walks the dataclass tensor fields (`next_token_logits`, `hidden_states`, and any other tensor field) and leaves the rest untouched through `dataclasses.replace`. Thats the same set of fields the full decode runner slices in `_process_output_after_replay`; the non-tensor fields are filled later by the sampler, so preserving them is correct.\n\nValidated on GLM-5.3-Flash (DSA, tilelang backends, TP4): with `--cuda-graph-backend-decode breakable` capture now succeeds, decode runs through the graph, and GSM8K matches the non-breakable baseline (24/25 either way). The change is additive (new branches before the existing raise) and device-agnostic, so the default full path and the CUDA path are unchanged.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37033508220](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37033508220)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37033507998](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37033507998)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37033508097](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37033508097)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
      "changedFiles": 1,
